    <string name="live_sensor_snapshot">Codes + sensor snapshot</string>
    <string name="live_snapshot_explainer">Reads generic emissions codes, then requests each positively advertised reading in the implemented Mode 01 catalog once. Responders can return separate values; the sequential observations are not simultaneous. It uses the same bounded adapter setup and closes after the pass. Not yet tested on a vehicle. Hardware use needs separate owner authorization; never clear codes.</string>
    <string name="live_explainer">Reads the supported-reading map and stored and pending trouble codes from the car (0100, 03 and 07). It also sends the adapter setup commands ATE0, ATL0, ATH1 and ATSP0 (automatic protocol detection) first, and ATDPN after 0100 to report the protocol found. Detection usually takes a few seconds and is stopped after about a minute at most. It never requests live sensor readings or clears codes. Car parked, ignition on, engine off.</string>
